{"id":"gelegenheit","lemma":"Gelegenheit","pos":"noun","rank":1075,"glosses":["opportunity, chance, instance, occasion","facility (facilities), accommodation"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/18/De-Gelegenheit.ogg/De-Gelegenheit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Gelegenheit","plural":"Gelegenheiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Das war eine gute Gelegenheit.","en":"It was a good opportunity.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Du hast die Gelegenheit verpasst.","en":"You've missed the boat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760091","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to miss (be late for","l":"verpassen"}]},{"text":"Du hattest jede Menge Gelegenheiten.","en":"You've had plenty of opportunities.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"a lot of"]]},{"text":"Die Gelegenheit wartet auf Niemanden.","en":"Opportunity waits for no one.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to wait","l":"warten"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"nobody, no one","l":"niemand"}]},{"text":"Ich hatte einfach nicht die Gelegenheit.","en":"I just haven't had the chance.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"easy"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}